---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Code · MethaneSET"
  description="Load and query MethaneSET from Python, R, Julia or the browser, and reproduce the validation notebooks."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Code</p>
      <h2>Load and query</h2>
      <p>
        Metadata is a Parquet index; imagery is cloud-optimized. Read the index, filter
        what you need, then fetch only those pixels by byte range.
      </p>

      <h3>Python</h3>
      <pre class="code"><span class="tok-com"># pip install taco-eo</span>
<span class="tok-key">import</span> taco

ds = taco.load(
  <span class="tok-str">"hf://datasets/tacofoundation/methaneset/methaneset-emit"</span>
)
df = ds.metadata()
df[df[<span class="tok-str">"site:country"</span>] == <span class="tok-str">"Turkmenistan"</span>]</pre>

      <h3>Tutorials</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a href="https://colab.research.google.com/github/tacofoundation/methaneset/blob/main/notebooks/01_multispectral.ipynb" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            Multispectral plume detection (Sentinel-2 / Landsat-8/9)
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://colab.research.google.com/github/tacofoundation/methaneset/blob/main/notebooks/02_hyperspectral.ipynb" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            Hyperspectral plume detection (EMIT)
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Other clients</h3>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Language</th><th>Install</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>R</td><td><code>install.packages("taco", repos = "https://asterisk-labs.r-universe.dev")</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Julia</td><td><code>Pkg.add("Taco")</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td>JavaScript</td><td><code>npm install @asterisk-labs/taco</code></td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <span class="src">
        Notebooks and clients from the
        <a href="https://huggingface.co/datasets/tacofoundation/methaneset" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          MethaneSET dataset card
        </a>.
      </span>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
